    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39479" root="نخت" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْحَتٌ</span></b>  (tropical:)  The <i>source,</i> or <i>origin,</i> of a man, [from
which he is, as it were, cut out]: pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنَاحِتُ</span>.
(TA.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَحْتٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ مِنْ مَنْحَتِ صِدْقٍ</span>
<i>He is of an excellent source,</i> or <i>origin.</i> (A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُمْ كِرَامُ المَنَاحِتِ</span> <i>They are of generous sources,</i> or
<i>origins.</i> (A.)

